WEBVTT

00:30:30.163 --> 00:30:32.954
I suppose it's personality. I don't know.

00:30:33.204 --> 00:30:37.204
Also, remember, I never got into
the academic, but, you know,

00:30:37.204 --> 00:30:41.121
I was I never had an academic
position in the university.

00:30:41.454 --> 00:30:45.913
I just got that PhD as quickly as I could
and went back and learned from

00:30:45.913 --> 00:30:48.163
the chimps. When you're out there
learning from the chimps,

00:30:48.454 --> 00:30:53.538
you can't get entrenched because you're
continually getting surprises.

00:30:53.829 --> 00:30:59.371
And you know the other animals, too,
that I've watched it.

00:30:59.663 --> 00:31:04.454
You can't get entrenched when you're
really absolutely keen